@CommentsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5154

### Get the first page of comments (newest first)
GET {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Accept: application/json

### Sort by user name, ascending, second page
GET {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments?sortBy=userName&sortOrder=asc&page=2
Accept: application/json

### Get a captcha: "id" and the picture ("image" is a data URI, open it in a browser to see the code)
GET {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/captcha
Accept: application/json

### Preview the text (nothing is saved), allowed tags: a, code, i, strong
POST {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello <strong>world</strong> <a href=\"https://example.com\" title=\"Site\">link</a>"
}

### Add a top-level comment (use the id of a fresh captcha and the code from its picture)
POST {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "john",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "homePage": "https://example.com",
  "text": "First comment",
  "captchaId": "<captcha id>",
  "captchaCode": "<code from the picture>"
}

### Reply to the comment with id 1
POST {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "mary",
  "email": "mary@example.com",
  "text": "A reply",
  "parentId": 1,
  "captchaId": "<captcha id>",
  "captchaCode": "<code from the picture>"
}
